{
  "job_B24.12.1_20260920_210400": {
    "text": "Her saga\u00f0 embe \u00fea twegen sce\u00f0an, \u00fee mid criste hangedon.\nHy w\u00e6re on ebreisc genemnede Achasachat, & Macros, & on Greckisc Malica, & loca, & on romanisc\nCismus gelifde, & dismus ne gelifde.\nNoes arc w\u00e6s III hund fe\u00f0ma lang, & fiftig wid, & \u00ferittig heah.\nSancte petres cyrice is \u00fereo hund fota lang, & twa hund fota wid, & \u00fear is twa hund swera & twentig, &\nSalemannes templ w\u00e6s sixti f\u00e6\u00f0ma lang, & sixti heah & \u00ferittig wid.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6ra wyrehtena w\u00e6s \u00f0e \u00feane stan b\u00e6ron hundseofontig \u00feusenda.\nAnd hundeahtatig \u00feusenda hine sni\u00f0on, & feidon.\nAnd \u00fear w\u00e6s \u00fereo \u00f0usend gerefena & \u00fereo hundred.\nIstorius s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feyses middangeardes lenge w\u00e6re XII \u00feusend mila, & on br\u00e6de six \u00feusend, & \u00fereo\nMan hafa\u00f0 bana twa hundred & nigontine, & he hafa\u00f0 \u00e6ddrena \u00fereo hundred & fife & sixti.\nAnd swa f\u00e6la daga beo\u00f0 on twelf mon\u00f0um, & hundtwentig geara hafa\u00f0 \u00feritti \u00feusend daga & six",
